{"id": "67472", "title": "半翼", "author": "最终章/亲爱的臭臭", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 16, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/67/67472.htm", "intro": "我知道顾莫修和我流着相同的血液。他是我的哥哥。\r\n　　可我们还是背弃了所有的神。\r\n　　我们尝到了污秽而激情的禁果。从此，我们堕入炼狱。只剩下半支不能飞翔的羽翼。关于显示生活中的罪与罚。\r\n\r\n　　无赦之罪\r\n\r\n　　\r\n　　本故事来源于真实。\r\n　　当某章写下这些时，一直控制不住自己的眼泪。\r\n　　在我的心中，只有一种无法出让的东西\r\n　　绝对唯一的最重要重要的东西\r\n　　我生命中的一切都是由它形成\r\n　　这种强烈的,炽热的意识\r\n　　无法用言语形容　\r\n\r\n内容标签：不伦之恋 虐恋情深", "base": "files/article/html/67/67472", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10400608.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10400610.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10400613.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10400616.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10400617.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10400618.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10400621.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10400624.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10400626.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10400629.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "10400632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "10400634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "10400636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "10400639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "10400640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10400641.html", "available": false}]}